title square screen: a card with a Mic boost keeps the CARD stepper with its level on the recorder
sizes 720x720
ppmm 800
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BOOST 1
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
expect text "CARD"
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "MIC BOOST"
expect text "-5.0 dB"
shot card-slot
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
